      <description>&lt;p&gt;At ICClean, we understand that your home or business deserves the best. That&amp;rsquo;s why we offer top-tier residential and commercial cleaning services designed to exceed your expectations.&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;Our commitment to service excellence is unwavering. We pride ourselves on providing a reliable team that shows up, does the job properly, and treats your space with respect. Whether you need a deep clean or routine maintenance, our professional cleaners are equipped with HEPA-filter vacuums that capture fine dust and allergens, ensuring a thorough and hygienic environment.&lt;/p&gt;</description>
